[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "text": "Travis Touchdown, correct?"
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "text": "Yeah. That's me."
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "text": "The No More Hero. "
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "text": "How unfortunate..."
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "text": "Right when I'm about to reach the top,"
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "text": "you have to find me..."
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "text": "I was hoping we'd fight after"
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "text": "I became number 1."
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "text": "Sorry to crush your dreams--"
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "text": "I hate to do it. But I've got "
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "text": "business with that son of a bitch."
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "text": "And I can't let you get to him first. "
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "text": "Please,"
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "text": "don't think of me as a nuisance."
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "text": "But I will make sure "
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "text": "your victory isn't easy."
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "text": "My pride as the 2nd rank"
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "text": "requires that much."
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "text": "Honorable..."
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "text": "I like that in a woman."
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "text": "I've seen a lot in my journey up "
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "text": "the ranks."
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "text": "An endless cycle of violence, "
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "text": "now broadcast as a spectator sport... "
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "text": "Why, Travis? "
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "text": "Why do so many assassins join, "
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "text": "if we're all going to end up killing "
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "text": "each other in the end?"
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "text": "Does it really matter why?"
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "text": "To me it does."
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "text": "It matters more than anything."
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "text": "We've all become trapped,"
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "text": "don't you see?"
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "text": "Addicted to the violence,"
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "text": "to a life in the shadows."
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "text": "Once we join the ranks, "
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "text": "we can never get out."
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "text": "Don't be stupid. If you get tired of"
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "text": "the battles, just fucking quit!"
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "text": "But that's why we all"
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "text": "want to fight you-- "
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "text": "to learn your secret."
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "text": "Don't you get it?"
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "text": "Get what?"
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "text": "You are the Crownless King, "
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "text": "the one who got out."
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "text": "You reached the top, then walked away."
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "text": "Well I'm back now, aren't I?"
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "text": "With you it's different!"
  },
  {
    "id": 49,
    "text": "You're the No More Hero!"
  },
  {
    "id": 50,
    "text": "Show me your passion!"
  },
  {
    "id": 51,
    "text": "Release me from this cycle!"
  },
  {
    "id": 52,
    "text": "Free us all in a crimson sea!"
  },
  {
    "id": 53,
    "text": "You asked for it..."
  },
  {
    "id": 54,
    "text": "Bring it on!!!!!"
  }
]